          "content": {
            "id": "afba6f30-b4c2-3e38-9e25-a43e38b7300a",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Airline CEOs meet with VP Vance to discuss shutdown impacts",
            "description": "<p>As the US government shutdown has continued for nearly a month, major airline executives met with Vice President JD Vance at the White House on Thursday to communicate how the shutdown <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/flight-safety-risks-grow-shutdown-214500140.html\">could impact the industry</a> if it drags on further.</p>\n<p>Yahoo Finance senior reporter <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/pras-subramanian/\">Pras Subramanian</a> comes on Market Domination to discuss the roundtable event, which included United Airlines (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/UAL\">UAL</a>) CEO Scott Kirby, American Airlines (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AAL\">AAL</a>) CEO Robert Isom, and several union leaders.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-domination/\">Market Domination</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "As the US government shutdown has continued for nearly a month, major airline executives met with Vice President JD Vance at the White House on Thursday to communicate how the shutdown could impact the industry if it drags on further. Yahoo Finance senior reporter Pras Subramanian comes on Market Domination to discuss the roundtable event, which included United Airlines (UAL) CEO Scott Kirby, American Airlines (AAL) CEO Robert Isom, and several union leaders. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more&nbsp;Market Domination.",
